# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) to configure the build.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_THESIS_FORM_ENDPOINT — optional
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Where thesis access requests are POSTed. Leave it unset and the request form
# composes the message and hands it to the visitor's own mail client instead
# (mailto:), which needs no configuration at all.
#
# Set it to a public form endpoint from a service that accepts a browser POST
# and forwards it to your inbox, for example:
#
#   Formspree    https://formspree.io/f/<your-form-id>
#   Web3Forms    https://api.web3forms.com/submit      (send access_key in body)
#   Getform      https://getform.io/f/<your-form-id>
#
# IMPORTANT: only ever put a *public endpoint id* here. Anything in a VITE_*
# variable is compiled into the JavaScript bundle and is readable by every
# visitor. Never put an SMTP password, a Gmail password or an API secret in
# this file — a static GitHub Pages site has no server to keep them on.
#
# VITE_THESIS_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
